# Jira Task

**Use for:** non-code or light chore work — docs, billing, ops, policy,
tracker hygiene — where a full Story/Bug AC pair is overkill.

**Do not use for:** feature development (→ `atlassian-jira-story`) or product defects
(→ `atlassian-jira-bug`).

## Create

Follow `atlassian-jira-create`. Prefer an Epic parent when the chore belongs to a
milestone.

## Description

Minimum:

```markdown
{expand:Overview}
<What must happen and why.>
{expand}
```

Add **Requirements** + **Acceptance Criteria** (per `atlassian-jira-description`,
including expand wrappers and **ordered** lists) when the chore has multiple
measurable musts. Skip the pair for a one-line chore only when a cold reader
still understands done from Overview alone.

## Done

A Task is done when the deliverable in Overview (and AC when present) is
complete. No PR is required unless the host repo says otherwise. Status
moves: `atlassian-jira-status`.
